nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvHsF6aBICnTdtnngVNzctYxk2oJ6_wjp4KT7rspbDNIQ&oe=69A58257"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jEekpsQErfIQ7kNvwF6pdZg&_nc_oc=AdmVbv6HC8aeyE3LQKOea1atDrJDIir0y7r5f9k1Fp8oaqyCNFzvt261B2tJwPpnRRE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvXgw6B45qTYWNZdlqN_xPE_mPWrs0zZlsbREL-tUCJCw&oe=69A58795"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iauqEUoZCS4Q7kNvwEpaSJW&_nc_oc=Adl8j-jpe_vRGswA1zUJhyHBA5VKswsLcnRaguylHX2NoDi98U02DmpaZ7SnedjBzFc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv9h4bw9ZOgHYCTakUUg1WHcJaQhp6xPwAzqKdhNdsqxw&oe=69A59B42"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eIRvyIEScrEQ7kNvwF2-_1i&_nc_oc=Admzr-fGWR5am-Z5W8QaFO_mbctfTtuSQ7rsD2zjjzTJOvj2Ejfzbdru91NoHTahPhc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftTGgvVSNa62HfhU9hLJELyjUJbOrCt1zhZYgYdghm2FQ&oe=69A581C4"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g-8GW6zYj94Q7kNvwEwUav0&_nc_oc=AdngHsLpFWjixkBxztwFkWMAoH40pOAcYFqABynINf5AdGgiQvLjRxXt712KI_7F1M0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs6tp4QcwZCV4x0b43RA3EsKZJ-y8bbUyBYnz16uoIYpQ&oe=69A57A22"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "874968081049627", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003276_874968084382960_490444167917392231_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OE46bMXBjaEQ7kNvwEoiTXG&_nc_oc=AdljnEtMiQCOH0YLK7vJhBBmx6SkmhD5md-1mNX0JaCQrfxTLTmdt8MBt67zz7dSPlQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvgdz3kExsGMTs-IYXFuWI7cGGYB7nwme